      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BANDIT ALEX (8) was never in contention last time after being shuffled back early at this track, but prior to that won easily by 10 lengths at this track (29.40) beating Flash Bandit in a Grade 5 on July 22. Can make amends. ZIPPING LILO (2) goes very well at the course with four wins and a placing from nine starts. Placed last time (30.37) at The Gardens in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 1.5 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. DARK CINNAMON (3) is having her first run over this longer distance. Strong winner last time by 0.8 lengths at this track in Grade 3/4 in one of the quickest times on the program (20.63). Looks well placed here and among the chances. SUTTON BLEND (1) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
